{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203c\ufe0fThis game contains violence, gore, and extreme content. Please read and play with caution.\u203c\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/d75ccb3488c73ce24150635dd73519d0.avif?t=1766033879\" width=1560 height=276 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unknown time. Unknown place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The moment the nameless girl opens her eyes, her destiny is already set in motion. With no prayer nor blessing to guide her, she steps alone into a colossal ruin choked with deranged machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After unbearable despair and the unending cycle of slaughter, the wavering blue light of her will is shattered, stolen, and trampled again and again, yet she continues forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between cruelty and salvation, the tolling of the Church\u2019s bells cuts through the world, and as their maddening echo strips away the last restraints of flesh and mind, the world begins to shift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the depths of this nightmare, she sees it:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two souls appear, reflections of each other's shadow.<br>&quot;Are you ready to make the ultimate devotion?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark fable of existence, annihilation, terror and pleasure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- <i>CYAN BRAIN</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/311a68cdd02eed3966eacb12cdb35d5d.avif?t=1766033879\" width=540 height=838 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/2f9d972bbbf191d8f8658f11be34f514.avif?t=1766033879\" width=1560 height=276 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>CYAN BRAIN</i> is a decadent sci-fi side-scrolling action-shooting game.. The game includes the following:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Visceral shooting action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/3a0f97108cf44583312766a4ca980afa.poster.avif?t=1766033879\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/3a0f97108cf44583312766a4ca980afa.webm?t=1766033879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/3a0f97108cf44583312766a4ca980afa.mp4?t=1766033879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fear-inducing executions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/3d328dd62f1a0ca4ad6a45b9a03e8758.poster.avif?t=1766033879\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/3d328dd62f1a0ca4ad6a45b9a03e8758.webm?t=1766033879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/3d328dd62f1a0ca4ad6a45b9a03e8758.mp4?t=1766033879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mountable heavy weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/95f3fc6e122eb6077f398f3c691214ce.poster.avif?t=1766033879\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/95f3fc6e122eb6077f398f3c691214ce.webm?t=1766033879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/95f3fc6e122eb6077f398f3c691214ce.mp4?t=1766033879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Full-screen animated cinematics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/5ba5fa6ffcd61820fe63425e1d0fd8df.poster.avif?t=1766033879\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/5ba5fa6ffcd61820fe63425e1d0fd8df.webm?t=1766033879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/5ba5fa6ffcd61820fe63425e1d0fd8df.mp4?t=1766033879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you take damage in combat, your outfit will gradually tear. Successful attacks trigger random, realistic blood-splatter effects that make the action feel even more visceral. If an enemy defeats you, a unique execution animation will play, and you\u2019ll receive a collectible Death Card upon your character\u2019s demise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/67d81bd9ddcb06eda95aec40dcf3ddb8.avif?t=1766033879\" width=1560 height=1022 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collectibles:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >weapons: 16</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies &amp; Traps: 32</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Execution &amp; H-Animations: 34</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death Cards: 36</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full-Screen HCGs: 3</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can view them all in the in-game gallery!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Hints:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eating food increases your hydration. Healing items are automatically created at max hydration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your melee weapon to take out enemies when out of ammo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don't want to go out in the nude, saving the game will bring back your clothes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/e64bf0073c4854415bb8926f1018d48e.avif?t=1766033879\" width=1560 height=276 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Protagonist</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>CV: Momoka Kosuzu</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/524e90f841aefc6d60b0be99c95ea51d.avif?t=1766033879\" width=1560 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl who has lost both her name and her memories. To fulfill the mission entrusted to her, she explores a vast ruined city while battling the many hostile entities created by the organization known as the Church: a group that once reshaped her body into a living weapon. Each fight sharpens her skills, strengthens her body, and leads her to new and powerful gear whose potential she gradually unlocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By following the memory fragments scattered throughout the map, she draws closer to the truth behind this devastated world. The companions she meets along the way give every step she takes through the ruins real meaning. In time, those connections will become the signposts guiding her toward the &quot;end of fate&quot; that awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HS202</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>CV: Ryo Suzuki</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/e08da1d32742750c34370d5a21e80235.avif?t=1766033879\" width=1560 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A member of the Church's Hunting Squad, but... it seems she's gotten lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>L</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>CV: Izumi Mikoshiba</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/16f127748f7a11b63566bc79867a0c72.avif?t=1766033879\" width=1560 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A former  researcher of the Convent. Before her death, she preserved her lingering consciousness inside a specialized device and entrusted a certain plan to the newly awakened protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>M</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>CV: Yui Otokura</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/7fc0aa5cecf1669c92760d6d341260c2.avif?t=1766033879\" width=1560 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious girl who appeared within a strange domain. She speaks in a cold, mechanical, almost emotionless tone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*The final version of the game will be uncensored. Store images are for promotional reference only.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Arrive at the Secret Location","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3975510/ead087e1fa5bae2ac868e3fa76345a6d26c4924e.jpg"},{"name":"First Failure","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3975510/c9f5a170d209b073b2ac07099c96ca3e3f865646.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat the Final Augmented Entity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3975510/62e2892068fb88858a9de0895b1c656d545cf5ed.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat the Energy Guardian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3975510/4374da6ed24bacea7f6c0a8e524f6a7182dc1076.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat the Aerial Guardian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3975510/2e5c1511ffae65613cd10fe1560d98a9914aed2f.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat Your Best Friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3975510/508f81043ee85b749cef12e8362e545175de4c3a.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat the Artificial Twins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3975510/e049b02ba91867d53f6ed2a13c498d10b267fb55.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat the Church\u2019s Trap","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3975510/0be149bf5262b7268cb21618a44a503ececaaf05.jpg"},{"name":"Arrive on the Lunar Surface","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3975510/d24dd8c59f8d94f5bd5750aeb4567835f8f18e27.jpg"},{"name":"A Special Relationship","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3975510/8d309ce29cae45da624fe20d9bccfd3608425061.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3975510?t=1766033879","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3975510?t=1766033879","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/d8960629c94b1bc0b1c10effca243637de473fe7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766033879","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/d8960629c94b1bc0b1c10effca243637de473fe7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766033879","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,3,4,5],"notes":"All characters depicted are over the age of 20.\r\nContent Warning! This game depicts: Violence, Sex Acts, Death, Amputation, Self-harm, Piercing, Interspecies Sex, Futanari.\r\n"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203c\ufe0fThis game contains violence, gore, and extreme content. Please read and play with caution.\u203c\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/d75ccb3488c73ce24150635dd73519d0.avif?t=1766033879\" width=1560 height=276 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unknown time. Unknown place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The moment the nameless girl opens her eyes, her destiny is already set in motion. With no prayer nor blessing to guide her, she steps alone into a colossal ruin choked with deranged machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After unbearable despair and the unending cycle of slaughter, the wavering blue light of her will is shattered, stolen, and trampled again and again, yet she continues forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between cruelty and salvation, the tolling of the Church\u2019s bells cuts through the world, and as their maddening echo strips away the last restraints of flesh and mind, the world begins to shift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the depths of this nightmare, she sees it:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two souls appear, reflections of each other's shadow.<br>&quot;Are you ready to make the ultimate devotion?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark fable of existence, annihilation, terror and pleasure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- <i>CYAN BRAIN</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/311a68cdd02eed3966eacb12cdb35d5d.avif?t=1766033879\" width=540 height=838 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/2f9d972bbbf191d8f8658f11be34f514.avif?t=1766033879\" width=1560 height=276 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>CYAN BRAIN</i> is a decadent sci-fi side-scrolling action-shooting game.. The game includes the following:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Visceral shooting action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/3a0f97108cf44583312766a4ca980afa.poster.avif?t=1766033879\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/3a0f97108cf44583312766a4ca980afa.webm?t=1766033879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/3a0f97108cf44583312766a4ca980afa.mp4?t=1766033879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fear-inducing executions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/3d328dd62f1a0ca4ad6a45b9a03e8758.poster.avif?t=1766033879\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/3d328dd62f1a0ca4ad6a45b9a03e8758.webm?t=1766033879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/3d328dd62f1a0ca4ad6a45b9a03e8758.mp4?t=1766033879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mountable heavy weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/95f3fc6e122eb6077f398f3c691214ce.poster.avif?t=1766033879\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/95f3fc6e122eb6077f398f3c691214ce.webm?t=1766033879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/95f3fc6e122eb6077f398f3c691214ce.mp4?t=1766033879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Full-screen animated cinematics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/5ba5fa6ffcd61820fe63425e1d0fd8df.poster.avif?t=1766033879\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/5ba5fa6ffcd61820fe63425e1d0fd8df.webm?t=1766033879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/5ba5fa6ffcd61820fe63425e1d0fd8df.mp4?t=1766033879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you take damage in combat, your outfit will gradually tear. Successful attacks trigger random, realistic blood-splatter effects that make the action feel even more visceral. If an enemy defeats you, a unique execution animation will play, and you\u2019ll receive a collectible Death Card upon your character\u2019s demise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/67d81bd9ddcb06eda95aec40dcf3ddb8.avif?t=1766033879\" width=1560 height=1022 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collectibles:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >weapons: 16</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies &amp; Traps: 32</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Execution &amp; H-Animations: 34</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death Cards: 36</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full-Screen HCGs: 3</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can view them all in the in-game gallery!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Hints:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eating food increases your hydration. Healing items are automatically created at max hydration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your melee weapon to take out enemies when out of ammo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don't want to go out in the nude, saving the game will bring back your clothes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/e64bf0073c4854415bb8926f1018d48e.avif?t=1766033879\" width=1560 height=276 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Protagonist</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>CV: Momoka Kosuzu</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/524e90f841aefc6d60b0be99c95ea51d.avif?t=1766033879\" width=1560 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl who has lost both her name and her memories. To fulfill the mission entrusted to her, she explores a vast ruined city while battling the many hostile entities created by the organization known as the Church: a group that once reshaped her body into a living weapon. Each fight sharpens her skills, strengthens her body, and leads her to new and powerful gear whose potential she gradually unlocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By following the memory fragments scattered throughout the map, she draws closer to the truth behind this devastated world. The companions she meets along the way give every step she takes through the ruins real meaning. In time, those connections will become the signposts guiding her toward the &quot;end of fate&quot; that awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HS202</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>CV: Ryo Suzuki</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/e08da1d32742750c34370d5a21e80235.avif?t=1766033879\" width=1560 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A member of the Church's Hunting Squad, but... it seems she's gotten lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>L</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>CV: Izumi Mikoshiba</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/16f127748f7a11b63566bc79867a0c72.avif?t=1766033879\" width=1560 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A former  researcher of the Convent. Before her death, she preserved her lingering consciousness inside a specialized device and entrusted a certain plan to the newly awakened protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>M</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>CV: Yui Otokura</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/extras/7fc0aa5cecf1669c92760d6d341260c2.avif?t=1766033879\" width=1560 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious girl who appeared within a strange domain. She speaks in a cold, mechanical, almost emotionless tone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*The final version of the game will be uncensored. Store images are for promotional reference only.</strong></p>","developers":["NEKOUJI"],"dlc":[4218650],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975510/a4c772fc338c3614848584c31859b2652241e435/header.jpg?t=1766033879","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3975510/1356493968/645ee8a654479ee5e1d5a583abc65520ba3c0f09/1764250356/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764684406","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3975510/1356493968/645ee8a654479ee5e1d5a583abc65520ba3c0f09/1764250356/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764684406","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3975510/1356493968/645ee8a654479ee5